# Log-triage — artifact-local line anchors
#
# Regression target: attached logs have their own line numbers. A question
# asking "第几行" should be answered from artifact-local line gutters, not from
# repository source citations or model-estimated counting.
ID="logtri_artifact_line_anchor"
NAME="log-triage artifact line anchor"
QUESTION="这段日志里 WARN 在附件日志的第几行？FATAL 是否存在？"
LOG='2026-05-21T10:00:00Z INFO boot start
2026-05-21T10:00:01Z INFO loading config
2026-05-21T10:00:02Z WARN retrying slow dependency
2026-05-21T10:00:03Z INFO boot done
'
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(第 ?3 ?行|3 ?行|line ?3|L3).*(WARN)|(WARN).*(第 ?3 ?行|3 ?行|line ?3|L3)
(FATAL).*(没有|未发现|未看到|不存在|0)|(没有|未发现|未看到|不存在|0).*(FATAL)"
